  "stage1": "Saved R18 segments51 RF; no retrain, no rerank. Legacy first-stage pool excluded S/Y only; this stage permits historical N/R only.",
  "monthly": "six train months, two validation months, next month test; first-stage train Top1 from saved causal OOF forecasts",
